[resource]
script = ExtResource("1_8iddf")
dialogue_id = "debate_moral_leadership"
record_title = "Debate Speech: Moral Leadership"
text = "PAGE: scribe(PORTAL_NETWORK), AUDIENCE
scribe: My esteemed colleague often warns us of the dangers of an organized faith.
scribe: I invite you instead to look at the shard that holds the first shrine we established after the Shattering.
scribe: The very day that the shrine was consecrated, a miscreant broke the fences of that sacred site.
scribe: Rather than punishing the trespass or erecting higher walls, the monks tore the fences down.
scribe: They opened their grounds to all, welcoming the faithful to share in the Enlightened One's light.
scribe: Today, the shrines on that shard are the beating hearts of each settlement.
scribe: Children learn to read and write from the priests.
scribe: When disputes arise, the people of the shard trust in divine wisdom rather than letting the local ruling council decide their fate.
scribe: Their donation box is left unlocked, brimming with coins, yet none is tempted to take what is not theirs.
scribe: You cannot achieve so complete a trust by following legal codes which change with every passing season.
scribe: You need a shared faith in ageless wisdom to guide you towards what is right.
scribe: It is the scaffolding which raises a society above its base temptations."
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://jtkfcsyiryo4"
